config BR2_PACKAGE_THIMSY_DATA
	bool "thimsy-data"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_THIMSY_NANO
	help
	  Nano's assets, installed to /usr/share/thimsy/system/etc/
	  from an allowlist that linux/tools/assets_allowlist.py
	  generates from ASSETS.md's KEEP rows (decision I38). Nano
	  falls back where an asset is missing.

	  Licences per ASSETS.md; the controller art is CC BY-NC 4.0.
